# Local AI provider secrets for `npm run dev` (Miniflare reads .dev.vars).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in your key, then it is picked up
# automatically. `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# Aliyun Bailian / DashScope (OpenAI-compatible). Get a key at:
# https://dashscope.console.aliyun.com/
AI_API_KEY=sk-your-dashscope-key-here

# Optional: override the OpenAI-compatible base URL (defaults to DashScope).
# AI_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1
